duced by last version</li>\n<li>reduce code style for node.js 4 support</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.4.0</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.4.0\">2019-07-31</a></br><h1>Features</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Support \"identity\" mappings for <code>SourceMapSource</code></li>\n<li>add option to <code>SourceMapSource</code> to show/hide intermediate source code</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Bugfixes</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>fix <code>size()</code> method for binary sources</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.3.0</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.3.0\">2018-09-20</a></br><h1>Features</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>add <code>name</code> argument to <code>replace</code> and <code>insert</code> in <code>ReplaceSource</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Bugfixes</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>fix incorrect offset when lines start with whitespace</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>Other</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>performance improvements</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.2.0</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.2.0\">2018-08-29</a></br><ul>\n<li>Performance improvements</li>\n<li>Improve quality of generated Source Maps when doing replacements</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.1.0</b> - <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases/tag/v1.1.0\">2017-11-26</a></br><ul>\n<li>Performance improvements</li>\n</ul>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.0.2</b> - 2017-11-04\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.0.1</b> - 2017-06-03\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>1.0.0</b> - 2017-06-03\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>0.2.3</b> - 2017-03-24\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>0.2.2</b> - 2017-03-24\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>0.2.1</b> - 2017-03-24\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>0.2.0</b> - 2017-03-07\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        <b>0.1.5</b> - 2017-03-07\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    from <a href=\"https://github.com/webpack/webpack-sources/releases\">